<title>GERMANY: German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</title>
<headline>German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table lists the economic and market forecasts for the six months from January 22 issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute. The averages are compiled from a survey of 312 firms conducted from January 7-21.</p>
<p>					  Base    Forecast</p>
<p>INFLATION RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    1.4     1.5</p>
<p>    U.S.				 3.3     3.6</p>
